 <h3 class="font-black text-brandBlue uppercase mb-3">How much should an authorized representative cost per year?</h3>
 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">For a single SKU or a small brand, a reasonable quote sits around <strong>€100–500/year</strong>; multi-ASIN portfolios typically run <strong>€300–1,500/year or more</strong>.</p>
 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Be wary of a quote far below that range — the service includes holding your technical file for 10 years and responding to authorities, which has a fixed administrative floor. If you import in your own name and are happy to be the responsible economic operator, you may not need a paid service at all.</p>

